## 综合控制流程

```text
读取左右红外对管
    ├── 任意一路检测到黑带
    │       ↓
    │     立即停车
    │       ↓
    │     向远离黑带的一侧转弯
    │       ↓
    │     向前离开胶带并恢复检测
    │
    └── 未检测到黑带
            ↓
        测量前方距离
            ├── 回波无效 → 安全停车
            ├── 距离 > 25 cm → 直行
            └── 距离 ≤ 25 cm → 左右扫描并绕障
```

## 红外滤波代码

```c
static InfraredState ReadInfraredFiltered(void)
{
    WifiIotGpioValue leftValue = WIFI_IOT_GPIO_VALUE0;
    WifiIotGpioValue rightValue = WIFI_IOT_GPIO_VALUE0;
    InfraredState state = {0, 0};
    int leftVotes = 0;
    int rightVotes = 0;
    int i;

    for (i = 0; i < INFRARED_SAMPLE_COUNT; ++i) {
        (void)GpioGetInputVal(INFRARED_LEFT_GPIO, &leftValue);
        (void)GpioGetInputVal(INFRARED_RIGHT_GPIO, &rightValue);

        if (leftValue == INFRARED_BLACK_LEVEL) {
            ++leftVotes;
        }
        if (rightValue == INFRARED_BLACK_LEVEL) {
            ++rightVotes;
        }
        hi_sleep(INFRARED_SAMPLE_DELAY_MS);
    }

    state.leftBlack = (leftVotes >= 3);
    state.rightBlack = (rightVotes >= 3);
    return state;
}
```

## 黑胶带处理逻辑

```c
if (state.leftBlack && !state.rightBlack) {
    CarTurnRight();
} else if (!state.leftBlack && state.rightBlack) {
    CarTurnLeft();
} else if (g_turnLeftNext) {
    CarTurnLeft();
    g_turnLeftNext = 0;
} else {
    CarTurnRight();
    g_turnLeftNext = 1;
}

hi_sleep(TAPE_TURN_TIME_MS);
CarStop();
hi_sleep(100U);
CarForward();
hi_sleep(TAPE_CLEAR_TIME_MS);
```

## 主循环核心逻辑

```c
for (;;) {
    infrared = ReadInfraredFiltered();
    if (infrared.leftBlack || infrared.rightBlack) {
        HandleBlackTape(infrared);
        continue;
    }

    frontDistance = MeasureDistanceFiltered();
    if (frontDistance < 0.0f) {
        CarStop();
        hi_sleep(250U);
        continue;
    }

    if (frontDistance <= SAFE_DISTANCE_CM) {
        AvoidObstacle();
    } else {
        CarForward();
        hi_sleep(CONTROL_PERIOD_MS);
    }
}
```

## 关键参数

```c
#define SAFE_DISTANCE_CM           25.0f
#define FORWARD_SPEED              90
#define REVERSE_SPEED              80
#define TURN_SPEED                 85
#define OBSTACLE_TURN_TIME_MS      500U
#define TAPE_STOP_TIME_MS          150U
#define TAPE_TURN_TIME_MS          520U
#define TAPE_CLEAR_TIME_MS         260U
#define INFRARED_SAMPLE_COUNT      5
#define INFRARED_SAMPLE_DELAY_MS   4U
```

| 参数 | 作用 |
| --- | --- |
| `SAFE_DISTANCE_CM` | 超声波避障距离 |
| `OBSTACLE_TURN_TIME_MS` | 遇到墙时的转向时间 |
| `TAPE_STOP_TIME_MS` | 检测到黑带后的停车时间 |
| `TAPE_TURN_TIME_MS` | 黑带转向时间 |
| `TAPE_CLEAR_TIME_MS` | 转弯后向前离开胶带的时间 |
| `INFRARED_SAMPLE_COUNT` | 每次红外判断的采样次数 |

